claude_code.raw:
Agent image: ship ox session adapters, procps and the Claude Code CLI For a job to record coding sessions with ox, the image needs:
- the ox adapters from the release tarball, next to the `ox` binary, where ox looks for them;
- `procps`, because ox finds the agent process with `ps`;
- `@anthropic-ai/claude-code` at a pinned version, so a harness can call the binary di
